# Free flash, in KB, that an update package can count on: tools/make_ocbm_update.sh fails a package
# whose changed files (at JFFS2's ~0.7 of their size) plus the 384 KB spare exceed final_kb, and
# says when it exceeds trial_kb (Carlink then updates trial adapters by going back to stock and
# converting again). ocbm_update.sh checks the adapter's own free flash the same way.
#
# trial_kb: the factory adapter's trial, 28 Oct (ocbm-host install info: 1,252 KB free).
# final_kb: an estimate (about 3.9 MB, the plan of 28 Oct); no adapter is final yet. The bench (U3)
#           measures it on the factory adapter in final and replaces this figure.
final_kb=3900
trial_kb=1252
